# The headers on every file the site serves; the Worker's own answers under /api/ set theirs in code.
# The CSP allows the site's own files, one frame (YouTube's privacy-mode player), the talk flow's two
# scripts and Cloudflare's Turnstile (its script and its frame), the recording played back from the
# page's own memory, and requests only to the site itself. The microphone is allowed to the site alone.
# The referrer policy is never no-referrer, because the player refuses to play without one.
# test/site.test.ts checks this file against the pages and the scripts.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; media-src blob:; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(self), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
